              </p><p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>PMWATCH</b> 
                -- May 11, 2002 --<font size="3"> </font></font><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3">The 
                faces and the names of Palestinian suicide bombers: we've seen 
                them enough times on the front pages of US papers, we've watched 
                story after detailed story about them from newscasts and TV talk 
                shows. But when was the last time you saw the face of an Israeli 
                perpetrator of terror on the front page of your paper, and when 
                was the last time you saw a piece on Israeli terrorism?</font></p>
              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Please ask 
                your paper and other news organizations why they are not covering 
                the story below.</font> </p>
              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> You can also 
